- ✅ Guest review management
- ✅ Revenue analytics

### Admin Features
- ✅ User management
- ✅ Guide approval workflow
- ✅ System analytics
- ✅ Activity monitoring
- ✅ Platform statistics

## 📦 Dependencies

### Core
